  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Ever since the new 2020.1.1 update, Sync_VideoStream is incredibly unreliable. In my maps that use it, I have heard a variety of problems from people attempting to watch videos now with my video player. For some people, the video never starts. For other people, the video starts, but there is no audio at all. For others, there is audio but the video does not move. I am receiving a wide variety of complaints, not just among friends but of people who like my maps adding me and messaging me on discord asking me why it's now broken for them. It's very hard to watch a video with people when 1/3rd of them can't even see it. It's very hard to listen to a video with music when 1/3rd of them can see it, but not hear it.\nI am not personally experiencing these issues on my end, but a lot of the people that watch things with me are.\nMy world ID is: wrld_41e9a399-1fd1-49f5-baf5-24ad13de44d1",
